    "quote": "Since both gene expression features and cell type embeddings are in different modalities compared to DNA tokens, we apply trainable modality alignment tensors /u1D416 /u1D454 and /u1D416 /u1D452 to convert /u1D49B /u1D454 and /u1D49B /u1D450 into language embedding tokens /u1D407 /u1D454 ∈ ℝ /u1D48D /u1D454 × /u1D485 ℎ and /u1D407 /u1D450 ∈ ℝ /u1D48D /u1D450 × /u1D485 ℎ , which have the same dimensionality as the nucleotide token embedding space /u1D485 ℎ in the DNA LLM:",
